<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CST raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CST raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell analyst Adriana Lacombe has raised her rating for Brazilian steel company Companhia Siderurgica de Tubarao SA, or CST, to buy from sell.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We are reducing our fiscal 1997 estimated earnings from $131 million to $85.5 million, but we are upgrading the stock to a buy,&quot; she wrote in an April 7 report.</p>
<p>-- She noted in part that year-on-year sales revenues were stable in the fourth quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street Desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
